{"vid":"tsVfvT5i1e8","source":"tsVfvT5i1e8.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":11,"txt":"Some work environments create special"},{"t":13.3,"txt":"electrical hazards, and it's important"},{"t":15.9,"txt":"for you to know about these situations"},{"t":18,"txt":"so you can take appropriate safety"},{"t":19.7,"txt":"precautions."},{"t":21.3,"txt":"The first thing to remember is that"},{"t":23,"txt":"water conducts electricity. Using"},{"t":25.5,"txt":"electrical equipment in the rain or"},{"t":27.3,"txt":"areas that are wet creates very serious"},{"t":30,"txt":"shock hazards."},{"t":31.9,"txt":"Even double insulated tools can give you"},{"t":34.1,"txt":"a shock if water gets inside them."},{"t":36.9,"txt":"So, OSHA recommends not using electrical"},{"t":39.4,"txt":"tools in damp conditions at all unless"},{"t":42,"txt":"the tool is connected to a ground fault"},{"t":44,"txt":"circuit interrupter GFCI."},{"t":47.4,"txt":"You should keep power and extension"},{"t":49,"txt":"cords out of puddles as well."},{"t":51.5,"txt":"It's also a good idea to wear shoes with"},{"t":53.6,"txt":"non-conductive soles."},{"t":55.9,"txt":"Make sure your hands are dry before you"},{"t":57.9,"txt":"plug anything in, too."},{"t":60.1,"txt":"And never plug in extension cords or"},{"t":62.4,"txt":"electrical equipment that has gotten"},{"t":64.1,"txt":"wet."},{"t":65.6,"txt":"High voltage power lines also create"},{"t":68,"txt":"special hazards. If possible, the line"},{"t":70.8,"txt":"should be de-energized before you begin"},{"t":72.9,"txt":"working near them."},{"t":74.5,"txt":"When that's not possible, it's crucial"},{"t":76.4,"txt":"to stay safe distance away."},{"t":79.1,"txt":"Keep yourself and any conductive object"},{"t":81.7,"txt":"that you're holding at least 10 ft away"},{"t":84.1,"txt":"from any power line that's carrying up"},{"t":86.4,"txt":"to 50,000 V."},{"t":88.8,"txt":"If the voltage is higher, you should"},{"t":90.7,"txt":"stay even further away."},{"t":93.2,"txt":"It's critical to remember that you must"},{"t":95,"txt":"also maintain these distances if you're"},{"t":97.1,"txt":"driving a vehicle or operating equipment"},{"t":99.8,"txt":"such as a forklift or a boom crane."},{"t":103.2,"txt":"If they get too close to a live wire,"},{"t":105.8,"txt":"the electricity can try to go to ground"},{"t":108.2,"txt":"through them and you."},{"t":111.1,"txt":"Metal ladders can also create problems,"},{"t":113.6,"txt":"no matter what the voltage is. Never use"},{"t":116.4,"txt":"a metal ladder when you're working near"},{"t":118.2,"txt":"power lines, electrical wiring, or"},{"t":120.5,"txt":"energized machine parts."},{"t":122.9,"txt":"The metal will conduct stray electricity"},{"t":124.8,"txt":"straight to your body."},{"t":126.9,"txt":"Use a non-conductive fiberglass or"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"wooden ladder instead."},{"t":131.7,"txt":"Sparks are something else you need to"},{"t":133.3,"txt":"watch out for. Since electric tools and"},{"t":135.8,"txt":"machinery can create sparks when they're"},{"t":137.7,"txt":"operating, they can cause problems in"},{"t":139.9,"txt":"work areas that contain flammable"},{"t":141.7,"txt":"materials, since a stray spark could"},{"t":144.2,"txt":"easily ignite them."},{"t":146.4,"txt":"If there could be flammable gases or"},{"t":148.3,"txt":"vapors in an area you want to work in,"},{"t":150.4,"txt":"stop. Don't turn electrical equipment on"},{"t":153.4,"txt":"or off. It could cause a fire or even an"},{"t":156.6,"txt":"explosion."},{"t":158,"txt":"Make sure the atmosphere has cleared"},{"t":159.8,"txt":"before you touch a switch."},{"t":162.6,"txt":"When you're working around high-energy"},{"t":164.2,"txt":"electrical systems, it's also important"},{"t":166.6,"txt":"to understand the potential for arc"},{"t":168.4,"txt":"flash."},{"t":170,"txt":"An arc flash is essentially an"},{"t":172,"txt":"electrical explosion that creates enough"},{"t":174.6,"txt":"heat, light, noise, and power to injure"},{"t":177.4,"txt":"or kill anyone unlucky enough to be near"},{"t":179.7,"txt":"it."},{"t":181.3,"txt":"There are several things that can cause"},{"t":182.9,"txt":"an arc flash. Accidentally dropping a"},{"t":185.3,"txt":"metal tool into high-voltage equipment"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"can create one."},{"t":189,"txt":"So can digging or cutting into a power"},{"t":190.9,"txt":"line."},{"t":192,"txt":"Shorting out a high-voltage electrical"},{"t":194,"txt":"panel can cause an arc flash, too."},{"t":197,"txt":"Fortunately, most arc flash hazards are"},{"t":199,"txt":"clearly labeled, so pay attention."},{"t":201.8,"txt":"And talk to your supervisor before"},{"t":203.5,"txt":"starting any work near a potential arc"},{"t":205.7,"txt":"flash environment."}],"words":[{"t":11,"w":"Some"},{"t":11.44,"w":"work"},{"t":11.64,"w":"environments"},{"t":12.28,"w":"create"},{"t":12.76,"w":"special"},{"t":13.32,"w":"electrical"},{"t":13.88,"w":"hazards,"},{"t":15.04,"w":"and"},{"t":15.2,"w":"it's"},{"t":15.36,"w":"important"},{"t":15.88,"w":"for"},{"t":16,"w":"you"},{"t":16.12,"w":"to"},{"t":16.24,"w":"know"},{"t":16.44,"w":"about"},{"t":16.8,"w":"these"},{"t":17,"w":"situations"},{"t":18.04,"w":"so"},{"t":18.2,"w":"you"},{"t":18.32,"w":"can"},{"t":18.48,"w":"take"},{"t":18.72,"w":"appropriate"},{"t":19.36,"w":"safety"},{"t":19.72,"w":"precautions."},{"t":21.32,"w":"The"},{"t":21.48,"w":"first"},{"t":21.84,"w":"thing"},{"t":22,"w":"to"},{"t":22.12,"w":"remember"},{"t":22.6,"w":"is"},{"t":22.76,"w":"that"},{"t":23,"w":"water"},{"t":23.4,"w":"conducts"},{"t":23.96,"w":"electricity."},{"t":25.12,"w":"Using"},{"t":25.52,"w":"electrical"},{"t":26.08,"w":"equipment"},{"t":26.56,"w":"in"},{"t":26.68,"w":"the"},{"t":26.8,"w":"rain"},{"t":27.12,"w":"or"},{"t":27.32,"w":"areas"},{"t":27.72,"w":"that"},{"t":27.84,"w":"are"},{"t":27.96,"w":"wet"},{"t":28.52,"w":"creates"},{"t":28.92,"w":"very"},{"t":29.36,"w":"serious"},{"t":29.96,"w":"shock"},{"t":30.32,"w":"hazards."},{"t":31.88,"w":"Even"},{"t":32.279,"w":"double"},{